    {
      "text": "After configuring field unification, you can manage unification rule sets and the rules they contain."
    },
    {
      "text": "For access to field unification, your assigned role must include the Read, Create, Edit, and Delete permissions under the Platform - Model Management resource. To learn more, see Creating Custom Roles and Managing User Roles."
    },
    {
      "text": "See image."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Managing Field Unification Rule Sets",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "When managing field unification rule sets, you can perform the following actions:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Process Entity Rule Sets",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "View Entity Management Runs",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "To view entity management runs:",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Agentic SecOps Platform Admin Portal, click Configure.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          51,
          60
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the left-side navigation, go to Data Unification > Fields.",
